<item>
            <title>[JGVT-4245] Reports_Audit Trail: Experiment audit trail improvement add missing actions (text, file)(update JGVT-25 / JGVT-2663)</title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-4245</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;As a User,&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
I want to be able to access the experiment audit trail reports in a review friendly format to allow targeted GxP audit trail review of all actions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;DEV notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;old versus new value on files might not be possible - to be confirmed by Cody/Alex&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;adding, modifying, trashing files should minimum be part of the report&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;TEST notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;add, modify and trash text fields to verify this is included in the reports&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;add, modify and trash files to verify this is included in the reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
